the function is valid starting from $12$ P.M., we can conclude our interval is $[0,4].$\n\nApplying the average value formula, we find that the average value of the function is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{P}_{\\text{avg}} & =\\frac{1}{b-a}{\\int }_{a}^{b}P(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4-0}{\\int }_{0}^{4}(200+8\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{4}t))\\text{d}t \\\\  & ={\\frac{1}{4}(200t-\\frac{32}{\\pi }\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi \\,t}{4}))|}_{0}^{4} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}[(200\\cdot 4-\\frac{32}{\\pi }\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi \\cdot 4}{4}))-(200\\cdot 0-\\frac{32}{\\pi }\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi \\cdot 0}{4}))] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}[(800-\\frac{32}{\\pi }\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi ))-(-\\frac{32}{\\pi }\\operatorname{cos}⁡(0))] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}[(800-\\frac{32}{\\pi }\\cdot (-1))+\\frac{32}{\\pi }\\cdot 1] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}[800+\\frac{32}{\\pi }+\\frac{32}{\\pi }] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}(800+\\frac{64}{\\pi }) \\\\  & =200+\\frac{16}{\\pi }.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139536150 true] [17592186386206 1000 #edb/ref 17592186386207 13194139536150 true] [17592186386206 1000 #edb/ref 17592186386208 13194139536150 true] [17592186386206 1000 #edb/ref 17592186386209 13194139536150 true] [17592186386206 1000 #edb/ref 17592186386210 13194139536150 true] [17592186386206 1000 #edb/ref 17592186386211 13194139536150 true] [17592186386206 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139536150 true] [17592186386206 1041 "selection" 13194139536150 true] [17592186386206 1104 #edb/ref 17592186386209 13194139536150 true] [17592186386206 1110 #uuid "a391066b-1032-502e-9574-3f5785d5542e" 13194139536150 true] [17592186386207 1034 "230-\\frac{2}{\\pi }" 13194139536150 true] [17592186386207 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536150 true] [17592186386207 1111 #uuid "afabe4d8-7a6f-581e-ac7c-40d1a4a33283" 13194139536150 true] [17592186386208 1034 "220+\\frac{5}{\\pi }" 13194139536150 true] [17592186386208 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536150 true] [17592186386208 1111 #u