{\\int }_{a}^{b}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ -12 & =\\frac{1}{c-0}{\\int }_{0}^{c}(3{x}^{2}-24x+23)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ -12 & ={\\frac{1}{c}({x}^{3}-12{x}^{2}+23x)|}_{0}^{c} \\\\ -12 & =\\frac{1}{c}[({c}^{3}-12{c}^{2}+23c)-0] \\\\ -12 & ={c}^{2}-12c+23 \\\\ 0 & ={c}^{2}-12c+35 \\\\ 0 & =(c-5)(c-7) \\\\ c & =5,\\,7\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139536150 true] [17592186386225 1000 #edb/ref 17592186386226 13194139536150 true] [17592186386225 1000 #edb/ref 17592186386227 13194139536150 true] [17592186386225 1000 #edb/ref 17592186386228 13194139536150 true] [17592186386225 1000 #edb/ref 17592186386229 13194139536150 true] [17592186386225 1000 #edb/ref 17592186386230 13194139536150 true] [17592186386225 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139536150 true] [17592186386225 1041 "selection" 13194139536150 true] [17592186386225 1104 #edb/ref 17592186386226 13194139536150 true] [17592186386225 1110 #uuid "f4094d65-6b28-5a5e-a444-6c61b553b938" 13194139536150 true] [17592186386226 1034 "5,\\,7" 13194139536150 true] [17592186386226 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536150 true] [17592186386226 1111 #uuid "9874b151-c44a-57b4-bf45-da4fd9dae072" 13194139536150 true] [17592186386227 1034 "2,\\,7" 13194139536150 true] [17592186386227 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536150 true] [17592186386227 1111 #uuid "c254bb8a-73d2-58cd-becf-150c62302006" 13194139536150 true] [17592186386228 1034 "3,\\,5" 13194139536150 true] [17592186386228 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536150 true] [17592186386228 1111 #uuid "8090e378-a201-589b-a78f-24fe960a065c" 13194139536150 true] [17592186386229 1034 "2,\\,3" 13194139536150 true] [17592186386229 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536150 true] [17592186386229 1111 #uuid "6b1c9533-4931-5bcf-8479-f763ed10be3f" 13194139536150 true] [17592186386230 1034 "1,\\,4" 13194139536150 true] [17592186386230 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536150 true] [17592186386230 1111 #uuid "5c6f7dde-de31-535f-b919-ce47ddd008e4" 13194139536150 true] [17592186386231 1017 #edb/ref 17592186386232 13194139536150 true] [17592186386231 1089 "q-74172" 13194139536150 true] [17592186386231 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139536150 true] [17592186386231 1100 "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14081209/assets/7ecbb53bb87156d11f9a9d8021182cdfb8c0c1749cd028780377bb61f32adf43.png)\n\nThe graph of the function $f(x)$, which is defined on $[-3,6]$, is shown above. It consists of the arc of the semi-circle centered at $(0,0)$ with radius $3,$ and two line segments. Find the average value of $f(x)$ on $[-3,5].$" 13194139536150 true] [17592186386231 1113 #uuid "fa6fc6e8-f5ff-590f-accd-6b5cf81b87bf" 13194139536150 true] [17592186386231 1145 "The average value of a function on a given interval $[a,b]$ is\n\n$$\n{f}_{\\text{avg}}=\\frac{1}{b-a}{\\int }_{a}^{b}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nUsing the additive property of the definite integral, we write\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{-3}^{5}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x={{{\\int }_{-3}^{3}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x}_{⏟}}_{{A}_{1}}+{{{\\int }_{3}^{5}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x}_{⏟}}_{{A}_{2}}.\n$$\n\nThe 1st integral represents the signed area between the curve and the $x$-axis, where $x\\in [-3,3].$ The corresponding region is a semi-cirle, so we find the area using the formula:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}_{1} & =\\frac{1}{2}\\pi {r}^{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\pi \\cdot {3}^{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{9\\pi }{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe 2nd integral represents the signed area between the curve and the $x$-axis, where $x\\in [3,5].$ The corresponding region is a right triangle, so we find the area using the formula:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}_{2} & =\\frac{1}{2}bh \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot 2\\cdot 2 \\\\  & =2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-3}^{5}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x & ={A}_{1}+{A}_{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{9\\pi }{2}+2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, using the formula for the average value, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}_{\\text{avg}} & =\\frac{1}{b-a}{\\int }_{a}^{b}f